msgstr "Babilim haikuweza kuthibitisha tovuti hii, kwa hivyo hakuna kitakachopakuliwa wala kusakinishwa hadi uthibitishaji ufanikiwe."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2216
msgid "Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed."
msgstr "Babilim haikuweza kuthibitisha tovuti hii, kwa hivyo hakuna kinachopakuliwa wala kusakinishwa."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3053
